From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato <remourato@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:25:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(quick-actions): send every result to Quick AI

Quick Actions now run through the chat's route and open their result in
the Quick AI palette, instead of a separate result panel. Fix Grammar,
Rewrite, Translate and custom actions write their reply back through a
Replace button on that reply; Summarize only reads.

- Quick Actions require AI Chat; shortcuts refuse with a HUD otherwise.
- Selection or page text rides as a text document, bounded at 32 KB.
- Per-action model routes, the permissive-guardrails provider and the
  Apple Intelligence default are removed; actions follow the chat model.
- Translate keeps Apple's translator and records its reply as a turn.
- Built-in Replace/Preview choices are removed; custom actions keep
  Preview or Replace on their record.
- Page results are never written back.
- Diff view and TextDiffEngine removed with the panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
